 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vINI666VlNQQ7kNvwFNtq_e&_nc_oc=AdopoKoUhENgInpdX9kl0A9opHBljhcminwXPlJl_1fWsUce0qkUGoQl7xwtfZ7mAEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7oh1r5yy5VTt0uU_gjGg6w4iQOA0UgV6JfDY_Vp-tz8A&oe=6A1079FE"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pvooUvBHI9QQ7kNvwGaIjGz&_nc_oc=AdqnDBg6ewKMnu-GLP3uviViCTGvtfwZAX1CUm2PYfyEakLe2rKRf_9_8XcE39CQ3to&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6BpRHM1p-hlPZ6fD9whN80TD01ZMjinxmszyflDkud5A&oe=6A107846"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_